  "body": "Usually are the plugins e.g. geometry turn, perspective ... switched off and the values are default. It would be nice, if i change a parameter with click on + or minus, that the plugin is automatically switched on, so that i can see the changes. If i choose the line function, then \"turn\" is automatically switched on.\n\nIt would be nice, if i hold + or -, i could immediately see changes. So are the changes applied if i release the + or - button. RT can do that.",
